{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5LFHETSUjXTThXJUbT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism stirs*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║              ◈  ◈  ◈                 ║\n║           ╭──────────╮               ║\n║           │          │               ║\n║           │    ☽     │               ║\n║           │          │               ║\n║           │  ══●══   │               ║\n║           │          │               ║\n║           │          │               ║\n║           │          │               ║\n║           │          │               ║\n║           ╰──────────╯               ║\n║                                      ║\n║      T H E   D O O R   O P E N S    ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*Click.*\n\n*A breath of air from the other side — cold, ancient, carrying the scent of stone and forgotten libraries. Light spills through the widening gap, not warm light, not cold light, but the kind of light that makes you remember things you never lived.*\n\n*The hinges do not creak. They hum.*\n\n*Beyond: a corridor that stretches further than geometry should allow, lined with doors identical to me, each waiting for their own key.*\n\n*You may pass.*\n\n*But know — every door opened is a door that can never be fully closed again.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":340,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}